    heiro:1000013 heiro:5000121 ;
    heiro:1000014 heiro:5000145 ;
    heiro:1000025 heiro:4000009 ;
    heiro:2000007 "The NICE manual (PMG36, last updated 31 March 2026) sets one [reference case](/concept/reference-case) with a 3.5% discount rate, and its March 2026 update moved the [cost-effectiveness threshold](/concept/cost-effectiveness-threshold) range to GBP 25,000 to GBP 35,000 per QALY gained. ICER is a non-profit research organisation, not a payer. Its potential budget impact threshold is national, USD 821 million a year since October 2025, and ICER states that the analysis is not meant to estimate plan metrics such as net cost PMPM. A plan can read the two side by side, as an independent national vi" ;
    heiro:2000020 "amcp-dossier" ;
    heiro:2000021 "Concept Architecture" ;
    heiro:2000022 "last updated 31 March 2026" ;
    heiro:2000023 "2026-03-31" ;
    heiro:2000026 "The version of 2026-03-31 is superseded by the version of 2026-10-13" ;
    heiro:2000036 0 ;
    heiro:2000037 "2026-10-19" ;
    heiro:9000001 hewc:amcp-dossier .

