    heiro:2000007 "- National Institute for Health and Care Excellence. NICE technology appraisal and highly specialised technologies guidance: the manual (PMG36). Published 31 January 2022, last updated 31 March 2026. Sections 4.7 and 4.9." ;
    heiro:2000020 "between-patient-analysis" ;
    heiro:2000021 "Concept Architecture" ;
