    heiro:1000025 heiro:4000009 ;
    heiro:2000007 "In England, the NICE manual (PMG36, last updated 31 March 2026) describes the national average unit cost of each healthcare resource group (HRG), reported through the annual mandatory collection of reference costs from NHS organisations, and points to the PSSRU report on unit costs of health and social care for inflation indices." ;
