    heiro:1000014 heiro:5000145 ;
    heiro:1000025 heiro:4000009 ;
    heiro:2000007 "The NICE manual for technology appraisal (PMG36, updated 31 March 2026) asks for estimates of net NHS costs to support national and local financial planning, asks that anticipated savings come with a statement of the extent to which those finances can be realised, and requires value added tax (VAT) to be excluded from economic evaluations but included in the budgetary impact where the resources are liable for it." ;
