    heiro:1000025 heiro:4000010 ;
    heiro:2000007 "The NICE technology appraisal and highly specialised technologies manual (PMG36, published 31 January 2022 and last updated 13 October 2026) has separate paragraphs on measuring health-related quality of life in children and young people. Section 4.3.13 asks, for evaluations in which the population includes people aged under 18, that alternative measures of health-related quality of life for children be considered. Section 4.3.14 states that NICE does not recommend specific measures of health-related quality of life in children and young people, and that a generic measure shown to have good ps" ;
    heiro:2000020 "chu9d" ;
    heiro:2000021 "Concept Architecture" ;
    heiro:2000022 "last updated 13 October 2026" ;
    heiro:2000023 "2026-10-13" ;
    heiro:2000024 "4.3.13, 4.3.14, 4.3.15" ;
    heiro:2000026 "The version of 2026-10-13 is current" ;
    heiro:2000036 2 ;
    heiro:2000037 "2026-10-19" ;
    heiro:9000001 hewc:chu9d .

