    rdfs:label "citation of NICE PMG36 in concept clinical-meaningfulness, Concept Architecture, 859ca9"@en ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/heiro-wiki.owl> ;
    heiro:1000013 heiro:5000121 ;
    heiro:1000014 heiro:5000145 ;
    heiro:1000025 heiro:4000009 ;
    heiro:2000007 "The NICE manual (PMG36, last updated 31 March 2026) asks for expected net health benefits alongside ICERs, using values of GBP 25,000 and GBP 35,000 per QALY gain (section 4.2.16), and uses QALYs because they capture both mortality and quality of life effects (section 4.2.15)." ;
    heiro:2000020 "clinical-meaningfulness" ;
