    heiro:2000007 "NICE's technology appraisal and highly specialised technologies manual (PMG36), last updated in March 2026, lists the factors its committees consider. The committee also takes account of the Health and Social Care Act 2012, which expects NICE, in its general duties, to be aware of the broad balance between the benefits and costs of care, the degree of need, and the desirability of promoting innovation." ;
