    heiro:1000025 heiro:4000009 ;
    heiro:2000007 "Under the NICE manual (PMG36, updated 31 March 2026), NHS England can also ask NICE to vary the period, normally for up to 3 years, when a medicine's net budget impact is expected to exceed GBP 40 million a year in any of its first 3 years of NHS use." ;
