    heiro:1000014 heiro:5000145 ;
    heiro:1000025 heiro:4000009 ;
    heiro:2000007 "The NICE technology appraisal manual, PMG36 (published January 2022, last updated March 2026), sets out its modelling expectations in section 4.6. Models should follow accepted guidelines, with structural assumptions and data inputs fully documented and justified, and sensitivity analyses where alternatives are plausible (4.6.1)." ;
